  <item>
    <title>EP69 影之刃、S赛还有十月番</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afd9a09a4a79edf137b4a0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afd9a09a4a79edf137b4a0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见~很可惜小电台还没有停更（</span></p><p><span>主要是因为十月番确实比较拉跨，再加上前段时间的影之刃所以鸽了比较久的时间，这次也是大半的时间其实是在聊影之刃，然后一时兴起又聊了一嘴S赛，最后才聊了几部动画，所以这期整体会有点乱，做完后期感觉还是不太会聊游戏，聊动画依旧是舒适区....</span></p><p><span>因为十月番没太多可聊的所以后面的更新可能会聊一些别的，大家有想听的或是好的选题也可以在评论区告诉我~</span></p><p></p><p><span>——— 时间轴 ———</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">1:31</a> 聊聊影之刃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 舔图支线的体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 印象深刻的boss</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 体验好转的几个点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 剧情文案有点瑕疵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3037">50:37</a> 聊聊S赛！</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4099">1:08:19</a>聊聊动画 fx怎么可以这么蠢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4526">1:15:26</a> 冰之城墙终于聊明白我看着别扭的点了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5102">1:25:02</a> 蓝箱气死我了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5634">1:33:54</a> 大肥鱼与关于之后的选题</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64d0ca5df50b650b28354bca/lo_StAjuXn7dBOBf0nC836DSFHQs.m4a" length="96984441" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:39:51</itunes:duration>
