  <item>
    <title>EP68 十月新番 有点失望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad8d6a3b381c0fcba19bb14</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad8d6a3b381c0fcba19bb14</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>十月真的有点失望啊，几个续作就药屋少女比较符合预期，剩下的连jojo都让我感觉有点慢热，除此之外更是没看几个，猫鱼甚至回去补七月番了，大家十月有看到什么比较好看的动画也欢迎在评论区补充~</span></p><p></p><p><span>——— 时间轴 ———</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">2:23</a> 蓝箱 观感好差</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 冰之城墙 好墨迹呀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> 药屋少女的呢喃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 小聊一下“婆罗门”心态~</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a> jojo！有点慢热？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2978">49:38</a> 脑洞学生会 看着很舒服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a> fx韭留美 真不知道怎么聊了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3891">1:04:51</a> 铁旅 电车画的真不错</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4173">1:09:33</a> PA厕纸 意料之外的还不错</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4697">1:18:17</a> 某暗部的少女共茜 我有点记不清了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4893">1:21:33</a> 坦克椅子 帅otto帅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5059">1:24:19</a> 补了点七月番（大小姐格斗 透明之夜）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64d0ca5df50b650b28354bca/lu_ftSunAi5Y92KJ0ZTnlOXBegAa.m4a" length="95097066" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmxtYs6rK23nzdcv9QfS63FQHzzH.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
